Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:02:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: hold a DVD wait until the players have played
 out

Kodi skipped libdvdnav's wait after one retry. With queues full only by
data size, a looping menu cell was read far ahead and its highlight
froze, and a title end blocked the player in closing a whole queued
title.
